  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>80</x><y>1310</y><w>570</w><h>170</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>bg=#FFFDE7
CLI command table used by dispatch(line):
  map, quests  →  render(getState())
  journal  →  getJournal()
  history  →  getRecentHistory(20);  history &lt;type&gt;  →  getHistory(type)
  save &lt;name&gt;, load &lt;name&gt;, saves  →  saveGame(), loadGame(), listSaves()
  accept, decline  →  respondToQuest(quest, accept)
  leave, flee  →  performAction(proposal)
  any other line  →  sendDialogue(line) in dialogue mode,
                          otherwise submitCommand(line)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
